OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillor's post branded
OL,4,Aracist by Labour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor has been
OL,7,Flabelled a "racist" and accused of
OL,8,Fposting "xenophobic conspiracy
OL,9,Ftheories" by a Labour councillor, after
OL,10,Fquestioning whether migrants and their
OL,11,Fchildren should be allowed to stand for
OL,12,Felected office.
OL,14,FEssex county councillor Carl Johnson
OL,15,Fposted a picture of Home Secretary
OL,16,FShabana Mahmood next to London Mayor
OL,17,FSadiq Khan, and wrote "we have been
OL,18,Fdeliberately infiltrated".
OL,20,FLabour county councillor Lee Scordis
OL,21,Fcalled on Reform to "expel him
OL,22,Fimmediately".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
